{"schema":"hsr-dialogue.v1","entryId":"other-interaction-p15862","chapterId":"sc8346fb5d3aca528","referenceCommit":"74a7b96fba32f00cf495a5c00b0311bd02207aaf","rows":[{"id":"other-interaction-p15862-01c835289893144bb2ec","entryId":"other-interaction-p15862","chapterId":"sc8346fb5d3aca528","text":"나, 난 끔찍한 광경을 봤어. 어둠이 태양을 삼키고, 찬란했던 궁전은 폐허가 됐어. 모든 게 심연으로 빨려 들어갔어……","speaker":"악몽 벌레","mission":"상호작용 기록","scene":"악몽 벌레","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["2347285508590446192"],"speakerHashCandidates":["139343424593219976"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-interaction-p15862-f59ea1555b3ef06f3e08","entryId":"other-interaction-p15862","chapterId":"sc8346fb5d3aca528","text":"너무나도 고독한 느낌이야! 고대인이 처음 밤하늘을 올려다보는데, 모든 별이 사라진 걸 발견한 느낌이랄까……","speaker":"악몽 벌레","mission":"상호작용 기록","scene":"악몽 벌레","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["8866246748729032617"],"speakerHashCandidates":["139343424593219976"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-interaction-p15862-80db6a43adcdb43af09a","entryId":"other-interaction-p15862","chapterId":"sc8346fb5d3aca528","text":"근데 햇빛은 여전히 환하니… 분명 꿈일 거야, 징","speaker":"악몽 벌레","mission":"상호작용 기록","scene":"악몽 벌레","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["5284457467392233789"],"speakerHashCandidates":["139343424593219976"],"speakerUnresolved":false}],"wikiReading":{"schema":"hsr-wiki-reading.v1","missions":[{"id":"interaction-p15862","title":"상호작용 기록","page":"虫鸣秘闻•3.0","officialMissionIds":[]}],"occurrences":[{"id":"other-interaction-p15862-01c835289893144bb2ec","rowId":"other-interaction-p15862-01c835289893144bb2ec","missionId":"interaction-p15862","mission":"상호작용 기록","sceneId":"sc8346fb5d3aca528","scene":"악몽 벌레","contextId":"wiki-context-26328ed4f67c26aaf2c43c67","page":"虫鸣秘闻•3.0","revision":72039,"location":[1,0],"conditions":[],"branch":[],"nextIds":["other-interaction-p15862-f59ea1555b3ef06f3e08"],"replyToIds":[],"status":"wiki-display"},{"id":"other-interaction-p15862-f59ea1555b3ef06f3e08","rowId":"other-interaction-p15862-f59ea1555b3ef06f3